I've opened #15890 to revive the fix from @kmcgrady's earlier PR #14941, which was auto-closed by the stale bot rather than on review.

It switches the custom-component iframe from `display: none` to `visibility: hidden` while the component is not ready, so the iframe keeps its layout box and the rerun on dialog-close no longer triggers the reflow that reset `stMain.scrollTop`. Added unit tests covering the before/after-ready visibility state.

